      "id": "mem-11",
      "content": "Confirmed by the controller: Vendor VEND-MRP invoice MRP-88213 was booked twice in AP (AP-00030 and AP-00031) for 12,450 CAD each in September 2026 but paid only once (payment BNK-00030), causing an overstatement of expenses by 12,450 CAD in September vs August. (CAD 12,450). Evidence: E8-2 finance_usl.vendor_bill+finance_usl.vendor_payment 1 rows; E8-3 finance_usl.vendor_bill 2 rows; E8-4 finance_usl.vendor_payment 1 rows. Note: controller checked the source documents. Check this first at the next close.",
